2026-10-13T11:18:29.7726786Z Run the POSIX AIO store benchmark.
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7726957Z 
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7727034Z options:
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7727257Z   -h, --help            show this help message and exit
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7727591Z   -w WORKER_NUMBER, --worker-number WORKER_NUMBER
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7727958Z                         worker number: number of worker processes to start
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7728282Z                         concurrently.
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7728672Z   -s SHARD_SIZE, --shard-size SHARD_SIZE
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7729011Z                         shard size: POSIX store I/O size. In layerwise mode,
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7729807Z                         this is the K/V tensor size for one layer of one
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7730186Z                         block. In non-layerwise mode, this is the K/V tensor
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7730541Z                         size for all layers of one block.
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7730852Z   -n SHARD_NUMBER, --shard-number SHARD_NUMBER
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7731500Z                         shard number: number of layers in layerwise mode; use
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7731844Z                         1 in non-layerwise mode.
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7732149Z   -b BLOCK_NUMBER, --block-number BLOCK_NUMBER
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7732693Z                         block number: total number of blocks.
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7733074Z   -d DUMP_EPOCH_NUMBER, --dump-epoch-number DUMP_EPOCH_NUMBER
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7733437Z                         dump epoch number: number of dump epochs.
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7734080Z   -l LOAD_EPOCH_NUMBER, --load-epoch-number LOAD_EPOCH_NUMBER
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7734457Z                         load epoch number: number of load epochs.
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7734807Z   -o STORAGE_BACKEND, --storage-backend STORAGE_BACKEND
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7735548Z                         storage backend: storage backend path; may be
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7735952Z                         repeated.
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7736367Z   --model MODEL         model directory (or config.json) for model-driven
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7736866Z                         mode. When set, shard-size/shard-number/block-number
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7737372Z                         are computed from the model config and override any
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7737810Z                         manually provided values.
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7738245Z   --tp TP               tensor parallel size; divides num_kv_heads per rank
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7738663Z                         for GQA.
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7738983Z   --input-len INPUT_LEN
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7739344Z                         request input length; block_number = ceil(input_len /
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7739773Z                         block_size).
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7740103Z   --layerwise, --no-layerwise
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7740501Z                         layerwise mode: one shard = one layer (default true;
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7741133Z                         --no-layerwise for non-layerwise, one shard = all
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7741559Z                         layers).
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7741876Z   --block-size BLOCK_SIZE
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7742259Z                         vLLM paged block size in tokens; used to derive
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7742678Z                         block_number from input-len.
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7743140Z   --kv-dtype KV_DTYPE   override KV dtype: bfloat16/bf16, float16/fp16,
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7743638Z                         float32/fp32, float8_e4m3fn/fp8, float8_e5m2, int8.
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7744089Z                         Default: config torch_dtype or bfloat16.
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7744567Z   --posix-data-trans-concurrency POSIX_DATA_TRANS_CONCURRENCY
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7745063Z                         posix data transfer concurrency (psync worker count).
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7745471Z                         Default 32.
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7745807Z   --posix-io-engine {psync,aio}
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7746170Z                         posix io engine: psync or aio. Default aio.
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7746561Z   --io-direct, --no-io-direct
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7746963Z                         use O_DIRECT for aligned file I/O (default true; --no-
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7747396Z                         io-direct to disable).
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7747843Z   --dry-run             print the computed profile and the forwarded command
2026-10-13T11:18:29.7748309Z                         without launching the script.
