2026-10-13T11:18:29.8879405Z UCM environment pre-check (versions, kernel, memory, storage bandwidth).
2026-10-13T11:18:29.8879693Z 
2026-10-13T11:18:29.8879956Z options:
2026-10-13T11:18:29.8880217Z   -h, --help            show this help message and exit
2026-10-13T11:18:29.8880574Z   --version             show program's version number and exit
2026-10-13T11:18:29.8881297Z   --config FILE         load thresholds/matrix from a JSON or YAML file (YAML
2026-10-13T11:18:29.8881698Z                         needs PyYAML)
2026-10-13T11:18:29.8882052Z   --mount-path PATH     UCM storage mount point (required for the bandwidth
2026-10-13T11:18:29.8882414Z                         benchmark)
2026-10-13T11:18:29.8882576Z 
2026-10-13T11:18:29.8882652Z bandwidth matrix:
2026-10-13T11:18:29.8882941Z   --shard-sizes LIST    comma-separated shard sizes, e.g. '180k,1m'
2026-10-13T11:18:29.8883355Z   --workers LIST        comma-separated worker counts, e.g. '1,16'
2026-10-13T11:18:29.8883779Z   --engines LIST        comma-separated IO engines, subset of 'psync,aio'
2026-10-13T11:18:29.8884133Z                         (default psync)
2026-10-13T11:18:29.8884484Z   --modes LIST          comma-separated phases to run per combo: subset of
2026-10-13T11:18:29.8884880Z                         'dump,read,mix' (default all; mix = read-heavy
2026-10-13T11:18:29.8885193Z                         1:rw_ratio)
2026-10-13T11:18:29.8885536Z   --threshold GB        minimum best aggregate bandwidth in GB/s (default 8.0)
2026-10-13T11:18:29.8885939Z   --block-number N      blocks per dump/load sweep
2026-10-13T11:18:29.8886259Z   --dump-epochs N       dump sweeps per combo
2026-10-13T11:18:29.8886559Z   --load-epochs N       load sweeps per combo
2026-10-13T11:18:29.8886939Z   --mixed-epochs N      read-heavy mixed sweeps per combo (1 dump + rw_ratio
2026-10-13T11:18:29.8887297Z                         loads each)
2026-10-13T11:18:29.8887627Z   --rw-ratio N          reads per write in the mixed phase (read-heavy; 0
2026-10-13T11:18:29.8887990Z                         disables mixed, default 4)
2026-10-13T11:18:29.8888337Z   --quick               halve dump/load/mixed epochs for a faster run
2026-10-13T11:18:29.8888951Z   --skip-bandwidth      skip the (slow) bandwidth benchmark entirely
2026-10-13T11:18:29.8889488Z 
2026-10-13T11:18:29.8889603Z thresholds:
2026-10-13T11:18:29.8889886Z   --kernel-min VER      minimum kernel version, strictly greater (default
